  "schema:description": "Vibrent Health has expanded the Vibrent Digital Health Solutions Platform (DHSP) implementation to additional populations among diverse user groups for additional validation of the technology's performance, usability, and reliability in refinement of analytics generating predictive algorithms for infection and that support individual, organizational, community and societal-level decision-making in the COVID-19 pandemic response. This included aims to innovate a technology that can differentiate between COVID-19 and flu (or other respiratory illness); development and testing of a novel WIFI-based contact tracing tool using a University's enterprise WIFI system and software release of augmented contact tracing capabilities in Vibrent's DHSP; and development of a full technical integration approach and strategy to support data exchange between this solution and the NCI data hub.",
